              "message": "Templates: no governed commit carries Anthropic's noreply address\n\nThe hooks drop Claude Code's Co-Authored-By line, the one with Anthropic's\nnoreply address, from a commit they make, as sealing does for a branch;\nDrafted-by names the model. An agent may name its model in a commit with a\nlast line \"Drafted-by: <model>\", which the gate reads as it reads Claude\nCode's line.",
